Description: RTEMS/ARM with MPARM patches
 RTEMS is the Real-Time Operating System for Multiprocessor Systems. 
 It is a full featured RTOS that supports a variety of open API and 
 interface standards. This package includes patches and BSP for MPARM
 from micrel.unibo.it

